Upstream / prior work:

  * rtl-for-vs-code-agents by GuyRonnen (GPL-3.0)
    The RTL detection/injection engine and the VS Code AI-agent integration this
    project is built on.

  * claude-desktop-rtl-patch by shraga100
    Prior RTL work that the upstream extension drew on.

  * "YOLO mode" (auto-approve tool calls with a countdown) — original idea and
