Modifications in this fork include: rebranding to "RTL & Agent Tools", removal of
the self-update mechanism, a cross-platform font stack and per-line input direction
default, quick-prompt (⚡) buttons, and removal of the Windows desktop patch and the
quota meter. These modifications are likewise licensed under GPL-3.0.
